<title>UK: Frome Co Ltd sets 350 bln lire two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Frome Co Ltd sets 350 bln lire two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Cariplo and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FROME CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    350 BLN ITL   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    24.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -5 BP     PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.25    FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    100.00</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
